ta-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7BorelIdeal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7BorelIdeal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\tau_{\\mathcal P(\\omega)}\\coloneqq\\left\\{O\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\mid\\forall A\\in O\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall B\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\bigl(A\\cap n=B\\cap n\\to B\\in O\\bigr)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\tau_{\\mathcal P(\\omega)}\\coloneqq\\left\\{O\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\mid\\forall A\\in O\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall B\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\bigl(A\\cap n=B\\cap n\\to B\\in O\\bigr)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}borel\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7BorelIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\omega\\notin\\mathcal I\\land[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(\\omega),\\tau_{\\mathcal P(\\omega)})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}borel\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7BorelIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\omega\\notin\\mathcal I\\land[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(\\omega),\\tau_{\\mathcal P(\\omega)})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topology is defined directly on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> by agreement on an initial finite segment, avoiding an unformalized identification with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch